# Huawei VRP display device esn parser.
#
# Sample input (templates/samples/huawei_10_62_25_253_display_device_esn.txt):
#   ESN of chassis 1:102599861597
#
# Real-device output places the ESN immediately after the colon (no space);
# older synthetic samples used ": " with a space. The pattern tolerates both
# by using \s* (zero-or-more whitespace) on both sides of the colon.
#
# Tolerates the V600R024C00 \"Error: Unrecognized command\" path where the
# chassis returns an error string instead of an ESN — in that case the
# parser yields zero records without panicking.
#
# Field semantics:
#   ChassisID — integer chassis identifier (1, 2, ...).
#   ESN       — vendor-assigned chassis electronic serial number.

Value ChassisID (\d+)
Value ESN (\S+)

Start
  ^ESN\s+of\s+chassis\s+${ChassisID}\s*:\s*${ESN}\s*$$ -> Record
